OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain at first, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, but clearing by mid-morning as
OL,7,Fa mix of sunshine and scattered
OL,8,Fshowers follow from the southwest.
OL,9,FShowers building late afternoon. Brisk
OL,10,Fsouthwest winds, perhaps touching gale
OL,11,Fforce at first over Shetland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers quite frequent early
OL,14,Fevening with some heavier outbreaks
OL,15,Fdeveloping, before dwindling from the
OL,16,Fsouth late evening. Cloud increasing
OL,17,Fovernight to bring some patchy rain by
OL,18,Fdawn. Southerly winds strengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
