OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FGales developing, perhaps
OL,6,Ftouching storm force in Shetland
OL,7,Flater. Cloudy with some patchy light
OL,8,Frain by day, which turns persistent
OL,9,Fand heavier for the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FShowery. Some heavier outbreaks
OL,13,Fappearing through to early Friday,
OL,14,Fthen turning less frequent and lighter
OL,15,Ffrom late Friday. Winds veering
OL,16,Fnorthwest on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
